{
    "name": "@orao-network/solana-vrf-cb",
    "version": "0.5.1",
    "description": "ORAO VRF with Callback for Solana: TypeScript SDK for the callback variant of the ORAO VRF oracle, which delivers verifiable, provably fair on-chain randomness straight into your Solana program through a CPI callback. Random numbers for games, NFT mints, raffles, lotteries and GambleFi dApps.",
